      {
        title: 'Tip',
        description: "Don't fall in love with a low pair; in 5-card Brag, a low pair is a very weak hand.",
      },
      {
        title: 'Tip',
        description: "If you hold a 3 and two wild cards ('Braggers'), you have the top hand (Prial of 3s).",
